  "content": "<p><strong>纯净玻璃</strong>是专为注重<strong>清晰度</strong>与无缝设计的建造者打造的核心材质包。该材质包移除了原版玻璃中令人分心的边框和视觉噪点，为您呈现真正透明的窗户效果。</p><p><strong>注意：</strong>如需实现连接玻璃效果，您必须安装<strong>OptiFine</strong>或<strong>Continuity</strong>模组。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fnikinok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3f28919b-47a6-4026-8e56-0d52a13170bb.webp\" alt=\"替代文本\"></a></p>",
